[
  {
    "content_id": "10030001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;犹大王乌西雅、约阿施的儿子以色列王耶罗波安执政期间，大地震前两年，提哥亚的牧人阿摩司看到了关于以色列的异象。以下是阿摩司的话。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;他说： “耶和华从锡安怒吼， 从耶路撒冷发声。 牧人的草场枯干， 迦密山顶枯黄。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说： “大马士革人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回对他们的惩罚， 因为他们用打粮食的铁器蹂躏基列。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;所以，我要降火在哈薛的王宫， 烧毁便·哈达的城堡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我要折断大马士革城的门闩， 铲除亚文平原的居民和伯·伊甸的掌权者， 使亚兰人被掳到吉珥。 这是耶和华说的。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说： “迦萨人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回对他们的惩罚， 因为他们把被掳之人全都带走， 卖到以东做奴隶。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;所以，我要降火在迦萨的城墙上， 烧毁它的城堡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我要铲除亚实突的居民和亚实基伦的掌权者， 伸手攻击以革伦， 剩下的非利士人都要灭亡。 这是主耶和华说的。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说： “泰尔人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回对他们的惩罚， 因为他们背弃弟兄之盟， 把被掳之人都卖到以东。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;所以，我要降火在泰尔的城墙上， 烧毁它的城堡。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说： “以东人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回对他们的惩罚， 因为他们拔刀追赶自己的弟兄， 没有半点怜悯之心； 他们怒气不息，永怀愤怒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;所以，我要降火在提幔， 烧毁波斯拉的城堡。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说： “亚扪人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回对他们的惩罚， 因为他们为了扩张领土， 竟剖开基列孕妇的肚腹。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;所以，我要在战争的呐喊声中， 在狂风暴雨袭来时， 降火在拉巴的城墙上， 烧毁它的城堡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他们的君王和首领要一同被掳。 这是耶和华说的。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说： “摩押人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回对他们的惩罚， 因为他们把以东王的骸骨焚烧成灰。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;所以，我要降火在摩押， 烧毁加略的城堡。 摩押要在战争的喧嚣、呐喊和号角声中灭亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我要铲除摩押的首领， 杀死那里所有的官长。 这是耶和华说的。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说： “犹大人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回对他们的惩罚， 因为他们厌弃耶和华的训诲， 不遵守我的律例。 他们祖先祭拜的偶像使他们走入歧途。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;所以，我要降火在犹大， 烧毁耶路撒冷的城堡。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说： “以色列人三番四次地犯罪， 我必不收回对他们的惩罚， 因为他们为了银子卖掉义人， 为了一双鞋卖掉穷人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;他们践踏穷人如同践踏地上的尘土， 使卑微的人无处申冤； 父子同淫一女，亵渎我的圣名。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;在每座祭坛旁边， 他们把穷人抵押的衣服铺开，躺在上面， 又在上帝的殿里喝剥削来的酒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;“以色列人啊， 我在你们面前消灭了亚摩利人。 虽然他们像香柏树那样高大， 如橡树那样强壮， 但我灭尽了他们上面的果子， 砍断了他们下面的根。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我曾带你们出埃及， 在旷野引导你们四十年， 使你们得到亚摩利人的土地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我从你们的子孙中兴起先知， 从你们的青年中兴起拿细耳人。 以色列人啊，难道不是这样吗？ 这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;可是，你们迫使拿细耳人喝酒， 禁止先知说预言。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;看啊，我要压碎你们， 如满载谷物的车轧过一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;快捷的无法逃遁， 强壮的无力可使， 勇猛的救不了自己，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;拉弓的站立不住， 腿快的无法逃脱， 骑马的不能自救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;到那日，最勇猛的战士也要赤身逃命。 这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;“以色列人啊， 要听耶和华责备你们的话， 责备我从埃及领出来的整个民族的话，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;‘世上万族之中，我只拣选了你们， 所以我要因你们的罪恶而惩罚你们。’”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;若非相约， 二人怎会同行呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;若非捕到猎物， 狮子怎会在林中咆哮呢？ 若非猎获食物， 猛狮怎会在洞中吼叫呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;若非设下诱饵， 鸟儿怎会落入圈套？ 若非捕获什么， 圈套怎会收起来？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;若城中响起号角， 居民岂不恐惧颤抖？ 若灾祸降临城中， 岂不是耶和华的作为？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;的确，主耶和华不向祂的仆人——众先知显明祂的计划， 就不会采取任何行动。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;狮子吼叫，谁不惧怕呢？ 主耶和华已发言，谁能不传讲呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;要向亚实突和埃及的城堡宣告： “你们要聚集到撒玛利亚的山上， 看看城中的混乱和暴虐之事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;他们不知正道，强取豪夺， 把掳物囤积在他们的城堡中。 这是耶和华说的。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;所以，主耶和华说： “敌人要围攻此地， 攻破你们的防守， 抢掠你们的城堡。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说： “牧人从狮口中救羊， 只能夺回两条腿和一块耳朵。 同样，住在撒玛利亚的以色列人被救回的时候， 也仅剩一角床榻和一片卧椅。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;主——万军之上帝耶和华说： “你们要听这话，去警告雅各家。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我追讨以色列人的罪时， 要摧毁伯特利的祭坛， 将祭坛的角砍落在地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我要拆毁过冬和避暑的房屋， 破坏象牙装饰的宫殿， 推倒许多宏伟的楼宇。 这是耶和华说的。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;住在撒玛利亚山上的巴珊肥母牛啊， 要听此言！ 你们压榨贫寒人，欺凌穷苦人， 又叫丈夫拿酒来畅饮。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;因此，主耶和华凭祂的圣洁起誓： “时候快到了， 有人要用鱼钩钩走你们，一个也不留。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你们都要从城墙缺口走出来， 被丢到哈门。 这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;“以色列人啊， 你们去伯特利犯罪吧， 去吉甲增添罪恶吧！ 要每天早晨献上祭物， 每三天奉上你们的十分之一。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们献上带酵的饼作感恩祭， 并且到处夸耀你们自愿献的祭。 以色列人啊，这就是你们爱做的事。 这是主耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;“我在各城降下饥荒， 使你们遍地缺粮。 尽管如此，你们仍不归向我。 这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;“我在收割前三个月停止降雨。 我在一座城降雨， 在另一座城不降雨； 我使一块田有雨水的滋润， 另一块田因无雨而干裂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;两三座城的人都踉踉跄跄地涌到一座城找水喝， 水却不够喝。 尽管如此，你们仍不归向我。 这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;“我用热风和霉灾击打你们， 叫蝗虫吞噬你们田园中的菜蔬、葡萄树、无花果树和橄榄树。 尽管如此，你们仍不归向我。 这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;“我在你们中间降下瘟疫， 如从前降在埃及一样。 我杀戮你们的青年， 掳掠你们的战马， 使你们军营中的死尸臭味扑鼻。 尽管如此，你们仍不归向我。 这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;“我在你们中间施行毁灭， 如从前毁灭所多玛和蛾摩拉一样， 使你们像从火里抽出的一根柴。 尽管如此，你们仍不归向我。 这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;“以色列人啊， 我要这样惩罚你们。 以色列人啊， 准备迎见你们的上帝吧！ 因为我要这样惩罚你们。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;看啊，那位造山又造风、 向人显明其心意、 将黎明变为黑暗、 踏在地之高处的， 祂的名字是万军之上帝耶和华。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;以色列家啊， 听我为你们唱哀歌：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;“少女以色列跌倒了， 再也站不起来； 她被遗弃在自己的土地上， 无人扶她起来。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因为主耶和华说： “以色列家的城邑中， 出兵一千的，只有百人生还； 出兵一百的，只有十人生还。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;耶和华对以色列家说： “你们要寻求我，才能存活。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;不要去伯特利求问， 不要进入吉甲， 也不要前往别示巴， 因为吉甲人必被掳去， 伯特利也必化为乌有。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你们要寻求耶和华，才能存活。 否则，祂要在约瑟家如烈火爆发， 吞噬伯特利，无人能扑灭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你们这些使正义变为苦艾、将公义丢弃在地的人啊，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;那位造昴星和参星、 使幽暗变为黎明、 使白昼变为黑夜、 召来海水浇在大地上的， 祂的名字是耶和华。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;祂使毁灭如闪电临到强者， 摧毁他们的坚城。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;你们憎恨在城门口主持公道的人， 厌恶说话正直的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;你们践踏穷人， 对他们横征暴敛。 因此，你们用凿过的石头建房， 却不得居住在里面； 你们栽种佳美的葡萄园， 却喝不到葡萄酒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我知道你们的过犯累累、罪恶无数。 你们迫害义人，收受贿赂， 在城门口冤枉穷人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;这是邪恶的时代， 所以明智者静默不言。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你们要弃恶从善，才能存活。 这样，万军之上帝耶和华必与你们同在， 正如你们所说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你们要恨恶邪恶，喜爱良善， 在城门口伸张正义， 也许万军之上帝耶和华会恩待约瑟的余民。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;因此，主——万军之上帝耶和华说： “哀号之声要响遍各广场， 哭喊之声将充满大街小巷。 农夫被叫来哭泣， 哭丧者被召来哀号。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;每个葡萄园都传出哀号声， 因为我要从你们中间经过。 这是耶和华说的。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;盼望耶和华的日子到来的人有祸了！ 你们为什么盼望耶和华的日子呢？ 那日将带来黑暗，而非光明。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;你们的光景将好像人逃避狮子， 却遇上了熊， 逃回家里，手扶墙壁， 又被蛇咬。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;耶和华的日子将充满黑暗，毫无光明， 一片漆黑， 毫无亮光。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;“我憎恶、鄙弃你们的节期， 厌恶你们的圣会。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;即使你们献上燔祭和素祭， 我也不悦纳； 即使你们用肥美的牲畜献上平安祭， 我也不屑一顾。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;消除你们嘈杂的歌声吧， 我不想听到你们的琴音。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;唯愿公正如江河滔滔不尽， 公义如溪流绵绵不绝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;以色列家啊， 在旷野的四十年间， 你们向我献过祭物和供物吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;你们抬着为自己造的神像， 就是你们的王撒固和星神迦温。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030005027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 5:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30005027",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;所以我要把你们流放到比大马士革还远的地方。” 这是耶和华说的，祂的名字是万军之上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 6:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;在锡安生活安逸舒适的人啊， 你们有祸了！ 在撒玛利亚山上自觉无忧的人啊， 你们有祸了！ 你们是列国之首以色列的显要， 以色列人都仰望你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 6:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你们去甲尼看看， 然后从那里到哈玛大城， 再到非利士人的迦特看看。 你们比这些国家更好吗？ 他们的领土不比你们的更广阔吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 6:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你们以为灾难的日子离得还远， 就大肆施行暴政。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 6:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你们躺在象牙床上，闲靠在卧榻上， 你们吃养在圈里的肥嫩牛羊。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 6:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们伴着琴声唱慵懒的歌， 像大卫一样为自己制造乐器。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 6:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你们以大碗狂饮， 用上等膏油抹身， 却漠不关心约瑟家的衰亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 6:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;所以，你们要首先被掳， 你们的宴乐将从此消逝！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 6:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;万军之上帝——主耶和华凭自己起誓说： “我憎恶雅各的骄傲， 厌弃他的城堡。 我要把城和城中的一切都交给敌人。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 6:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;那时，如果一栋房子里剩下十人，这十人也要死亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 6:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;亲属抬出尸体焚烧时，必问内屋的人：“你那里还有别人吗？”那人必回答：“没有。”问的人必说：“不要作声，我们不可提耶和华的名。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 6:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;看啊，耶和华一声令下， 大屋顿成瓦砾，小房化为碎片。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 6:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;马能在悬崖上奔驰吗？ 牛能在海中耕作吗？ 你们却使公正沦为毒药， 使公义之果变成苦艾。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 6:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你们炫耀自己征服了罗底巴， 吹嘘凭自己的能力夺取了加宁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030006014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 6:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30006014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;万军之上帝耶和华说： “以色列家啊， 我要使一个国家兴起攻击你们， 从哈马口直至亚拉巴河， 他们要到处欺压你们。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;以下是主耶和华让我看见的异象：看啊，祂造了一大群蝗虫。那时，王室的作物已经收割，第二季作物刚开始发苗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;蝗虫吃尽地上的青苗时，我说：“主耶和华啊，求你赦免！雅各那么弱小，他怎么受得了呢？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;于是，耶和华心生怜悯，说：“我不降这灾了。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;以下是主耶和华让我看见的异象：看啊，主耶和华降下审判的大火。大火烧干了深渊，正在吞噬土地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;那时，我说：“主耶和华啊，求你停止吧！雅各那么弱小，他怎么受得了呢？”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;于是，耶和华心生怜悯，说：“我也不降这灾了。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;以下是祂让我看见的异象：看啊，主站在一道按照准绳建造的墙边，手里拿着准绳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶和华对我说：“阿摩司，你看见什么？”我答道：“一条准绳。”主说：“我要在我的以色列子民中吊起准绳，我不会再饶恕他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;以撒子孙的丘坛必遭毁坏，以色列的庙宇必成废墟，我要用刀攻击耶罗波安王朝。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;伯特利的祭司亚玛谢派人告诉以色列王耶罗波安：“阿摩司在以色列家图谋背叛你，我们国家无法容忍他的言论。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;因为阿摩司这样说，‘耶罗波安将丧身刀下，以色列人必被掳去，远离家乡。’”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;亚玛谢对阿摩司说：“先见啊，走吧！逃回犹大去吧！你要在那里挣吃的，在那里说预言。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;不可再在伯特利说预言，这里是王的圣所，是国庙。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;阿摩司答道：“我本不是先知，也不是先知的门徒。我只是一个牧人，也看护桑树。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;但耶和华不再让我看守羊群，祂对我说，‘去！向我的以色列子民说预言。’</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;现在你要听耶和华对你说的话。你说，‘不要说攻击以色列的预言，不要传讲攻击以撒子孙的信息。’</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030007017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 7:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30007017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;所以耶和华说，‘你的妻子必在这城里沦为妓女，你的儿女必丧身刀下，你的田地必被人丈量、瓜分，你自己必死在异乡。以色列人必被掳去，远离家乡。’”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 8:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;这是主耶和华让我看见的异象：看啊，一篮夏天的果子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 8:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;耶和华问我：“阿摩司，你看见什么？”我说：“我看见一篮夏天的果子。”祂说：“我以色列子民的结局到了，我不会再饶恕他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 8:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;到那日，宫殿里的歌声要变成哀号；尸横遍地，一片死寂。这是主耶和华说的。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 8:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;践踏贫民、灭绝穷人的人啊， 你们要听！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 8:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们盼望朔日和安息日快点过去， 你们好售卖谷物。 你们用小升斗卖粮， 用加重的砝码收银子， 用诡诈的秤欺骗人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 8:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你们用银子买贫民， 以一双鞋买穷人为奴， 售卖掺了糠秕的麦子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 8:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;耶和华凭雅各的骄傲起誓： “我决不会忘记你们的所作所为。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 8:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;这片土地要因此而震动， 所有的居民都要悲哀。 大地要像尼罗河一样涨起，如埃及的河流翻腾退落。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 8:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;主耶和华说： “到那日，我要使太阳中午落下， 使大地在白天一片黑暗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 8:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我要使你们的节期变为丧礼， 叫你们的欢歌变为哀歌。 我要使你们都腰束麻布，剃光头发； 我要使你们伤心欲绝，如丧独生子； 我要使那日成为痛苦的日子。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 8:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;主耶和华说： “日子将到，我要使饥荒降在地上。 人饥饿非因无饼，干渴非因无水， 而是因为听不到耶和华的话。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 8:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;人们从南到北，从东到西， 在境内四处奔走， 要寻找耶和华的话却找不到。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 8:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;“到那日， “美丽少女和青春少男都要因干渴而昏倒；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030008014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 8:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30008014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;那些凭撒玛利亚、但和别示巴的神明起誓的， 都要跌倒，永不再起来。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我看见主站在祭坛旁，祂说： “你要击打柱顶，使殿的根基震动； 要打碎它们，使殿宇坍塌压死众人。 侥幸生还的，我要用刀剑杀掉， 无人能逃脱，无人能幸免。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;即使他们挖洞钻进阴间， 我也要把他们揪出来； 即使他们爬上高天， 我也要把他们拉下来；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;即使他们藏在迦密山的峰顶， 我也要去搜寻，捉住他们； 即使他们潜到海底， 我也要派海蛇去吞咬他们；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;即使他们被敌人掳去， 我也要命刀剑追杀他们。 我要定睛在他们身上， 不是要赐福而是要降祸。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;主——万军之耶和华触摸大地， 大地就消融，地上的人都要哀号； 大地如埃及的尼罗河涨起退落。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;那位在天上建造楼阁， 在大地之上立定穹苍， 召来海水浇在大地上的—— 祂的名字是耶和华。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说： “以色列人啊， 在我眼中，你们不是和古实人一样吗？ 我不是领你们出埃及， 领非利士人出迦斐托， 领亚兰人出吉珥吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;主耶和华的眼目察看这罪恶的国家， 我要从地上除灭它， 但不会完全毁灭雅各家。 这是耶和华说的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;“因为我要下令在万国中筛以色列家， 就像人筛谷物，一粒石子也不会落在地上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;在我的子民中， 所有夸口说‘灾祸不会追上我们，也不会迎面而来’的罪人， 都要死在刀下。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;“到那日， 我要重建大卫已倾覆的棚子， 修补它城墙的缺口。 我要从废墟中重建它， 恢复它往日的荣耀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;这样，以色列人必拥有以东所剩的和所有属于我名下的国家。 这是要成就这事的耶和华说的。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;耶和华说： “时候将到， 五谷还未收完又该耕种了， 葡萄还未踩完又该栽种了。 甜酒从群山上滴下，在丘岭间流淌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我要使我被掳的以色列子民返乡， 他们要重建废城并住在城中， 栽种葡萄园，喝园中酿出的美酒， 整理园圃，吃园中出产的佳果。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10030009015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "阿摩司书 9:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "30009015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我要将以色列人栽种在他们自己的土地上， 他们永不再从我赐给他们的土地上被铲除。” 这是你们的上帝耶和华说的。</p>"
  }
]